romoters, trusts and institutions to plan the institution properly and move it through each stage to operation.</p></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Who It Is For</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Trusts and promoters planning a new college, university or skill centre</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Existing institutions adding programmes, seeking affiliation or preparing for accreditation</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Skill training providers seeking NSDC or Sector Skill Council affiliation</div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">What We Do</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Vision and strategic roadmap</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leadi